{
  "abstract": "Lean formalization of the six headline result groups: Theorem 1.2, Corollary 1.3, and Theorems 1.4–1.7. Theorem 1.2, Corollary 1.3, and the asymptotic clauses of Theorem 1.4 are conditional only on Chen’s finite-mixture Parisi formula. Universal pressure lower tails are proved internally. The finite-dimensional Haar comparison and Theorems 1.5–1.7 have no literature premise. The manuscript and exact model assumptions are included.",
